{"content":"💡 **SUGGESTION: token accounting walks the ledger linearly per group member — O(groups × members × entries)**

```dart
final seq = view.seqs.seqOf(id);
if (seq != null) tokens += ledger.entryAtSeq(seq)?.tokens ?? 0;
